# Authors

## Lead

- **Yu Ching Lam** — ORCID [0009-0008-9113-769X](https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9113-769X)
  - Design and implementation of the fragmentomics pipeline, the
    cross-study benchmarks, the fusion estimator that replaced the
    neural encoder, the methylation channel and the reproduction driver.
  - Maintainer of this repository.

## Acknowledged

The people named in `TEAM.md` §1.2 contributed through review, data
provision, discussion or code — each is acknowledged there with what
they contributed, which is the record that matters for authorship.

## Adding yourself

If you contribute code, data or a clinical cohort, add your name here
and the contribution to `TEAM.md` §1.2 in the same change. Use the
name you want to be cited under, and add your ORCID iD if you have
one — the citation metadata in `CITATION.cff` is generated from the
author list here and from the release tag.

Authorship of the papers is a separate decision, made with the
contributors under the model in `TEAM.md` §3 and §4; contributing to
the repository does not by itself make someone an author of a
publication.
